.TH MOLTBROWSER 1 "March 2026" "MoltBrowser 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
moltbrowser \- AI-native privacy web browser
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B moltbrowser
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIURL\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B MoltBrowser
is a Chromium-based web browser with built-in AI capabilities.
It runs large language models locally on your device for private,
on-device AI chat, page summarization, code explanation, and more.
.PP
All AI inference is performed locally using llama.cpp with GPU
acceleration (Metal on macOS, Vulkan on Linux). No data is sent
to any cloud service.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-new\-window
Open a new browser window.
.TP
.B \-\-incognito
Open a new private (incognito) window.
.TP
.B \-\-ai\-chat
Open the AI chat interface directly.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Display version information and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-help
Display help information and exit.
.SH AI FEATURES
.TP
.B chrome://molt\-ai\-chat
Full-page AI chat interface.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Shift+A
Open AI chat sidebar.
.TP
.B ai: \fIquery\fR
Type in the address bar with "ai:" prefix for quick AI queries.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.moltbrowser/settings.json
User settings and AI model configuration.
.TP
.I ~/.moltbrowser/models/
Downloaded AI model files (GGUF format).
.TP
.I ~/.moltbrowser/chat_exports/
Exported chat history files (JSON format).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B MOLTBROWSER_AI_MODEL
Override the default AI model path.
.TP
.B MOLTBROWSER_DISABLE_GPU
Set to 1 to disable GPU acceleration for inference.
.SH BUGS
